  "description": "Tom and Jaemin are polar opposites, but are very much in love. They’re in their honeymoon phase, when no problem is big enough—or rather, “hairy” enough—to burst their bubble of happiness. But when a handsome next-door neighbor enters the picture, will their love be strong enough to keep their relationship from falling apart? \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
